⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of O-90
node WE1 · WE1 · ⟦O-90:WE1:97177f⟧

WHO   — O-90 — the number who wants a child
WHAT  — The simple human want the State forbids — motherhood as a crime she commits anyway.
WHERE — WE1 · WE  Framework inputs: We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the warning includes the ordinary, unpolitical heart: the woman who only wants to love and bear a child.
HOW   — By breaking the rules for a baby and being smuggled beyond the Wall to bear it free.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I only wanted a child — and in a world that schedules even love, that simple want made me a criminal who had to flee past the Wall.

